		<footNote></footNote>
		<table>
			<row>*;The function has a separate tree since it has 2 or more callers.</row>
			<row>R;This function is part of a recursive call chain. If both a leaf and the root of a tree are marked this way, all nodes in between are in a recursive chain.</row>
			<row>[&lt;stack&gt;:&lt;s&gt;,&lt;a&gt;; ...];For each stack the stack usage by the function itself (&lt;s&gt;) and the stack usage by the function and all its callees (&lt;a&gt;).</row>
